<title>UK: Avon buys rest of Czech Republic jv.</title>
<headline>Avon buys rest of Czech Republic jv.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British tyre maker Avon Rubber Plc said on Friday that it has paid 1.4 million stg for the remaining 35 percent stake in rubber components manufacturer Avon-Rubena a.s. of the Czech Republic from its minority joint venture partner.</p>
<p>Avon established the joint venture with Rubena a.s. Nachod in October 1993, when it paid 2.25 million stg for a 65 percent stake.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
